,{"seq":1222,"t":7500,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1862,"retries":0},{"seq":1223,"t":7500,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"It is Watch 26. Doctrine: Defend F1/F2 with inf/ele, Cav hunts riders between them. Rhino has forces at F1/F2. Kite has forces at F2. Orchid has forces at F1/S-mid. I should reinforce F1/F2 and keep cavalry active. The captured letters suggest an aggressive push from Orchid/Kite."},{"seq":1224,"t":7500,"type":"courier","id":"c419","house":"rhino","letter":"L512","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1"],"depart":7500,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1225,"t":7500,"type":"courier","id":"c420","house":"rhino","letter":"L513","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-2","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":7500,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1226,"t":7500,"type":"courier","id":"c421","house":"rhino","letter":"L514","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":7500,"plain":"HORSE, SCOUT NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":1227,"t":7500,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1883,"retries":0},{"seq":1228,"t":7500,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It is Watch 26. Rhino truce is active, so I must offer a truce to them as per doctrine. I see Rhino inf at F2 (2w ago) and I have inf units at F2. I should propose a truce via letter to Rhino. I'll position my units defensively near F2/N-mid while waiting for the truce to arrive."},{"seq":1229,"t":7500,"type":"courier","id":"c422","house":"kite","letter":"L515","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":7500,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1230,"t":7500,"type":"courier","id":"c423","house":"kite","letter":"L516","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":7500,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1231,"t":7500,"type":"courier","id":"c424","house":"kite","letter":"L517","kind":"letter","to":"rhino-camp","path":["kite-camp","north-village","rhino-camp"],"depart":7500,"plain":"TRUCE PROPOSAL","cipher":null},{"seq":1232,"t":7500,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1864,"retries":0},{"seq":1233,"t":7500,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino has strong presences at F1 and F2. Kite is at F2. Tiger is at F3. My doctrine suggests using cavalry to catch riders and sending foot based on captured letters. I will move my infantry to F1 and F2 to secure fords and prepare for engagement, while using my cavalry to scout "},{"seq":1234,"t":7500,"type":"courier","id":"c425","house":"orchid","letter":"L518","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp"],"depart":7800,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":"AEQRT AKKT, IBQOD TK WMRT AKQS."},{"seq":1235,"t":7500,"type":"courier","id":"c426","house":"orchid","letter":"L519","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-2","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":7800,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"RMOKJS AKKT, IBQOD TK IESSHM AKQS."},{"seq":1236,"t":7500,"type":"courier","id":"c427","house":"orchid","letter":"L520","kind":"order","to":"orchid-cav-1","path":["orchid-camp"],"depart":7800,"plain":"HORSE, SCOUT NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":"DKQRM, ROKUT JKQTD LBJG WMRT."},{"seq":1237,"t":7500,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1726,"retries":0},{"seq":1238,"t":7500,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"It is Watch 26. My doctrine is to take F3 (East Ford) early. I have forces at F3 (Tiger units). I see a Kite archer at F3 (2w ago) and a Kite cavalry at F3 (8w ago). I must reinforce and hold F3. Orchid has sent a letter suggesting holding S-Mid/F2, which might be a distraction.\n"},{"seq":1239,"t":7500,"type":"courier","id":"c428","house":"tiger","letter":"L521","kind"